# Decision Log

Chronological record of architecture/design decisions and the rationale
behind them, so future sessions don't have to re-derive "why." Full detail
for stack/deployment/core-logic decisions lives in `docs/architecture.md`;
this file is the compressed "what changed and why," in order.

This is a decision log, not a task tracker — task-level work lives in `br`
(beads_rust: `br ready` / `br list`). See the last boilerplate entry below
for why.

Each entry: **what changed**, a **Why:** line (the constraint/reason
behind it), and a pointer to where the full detail lives. Keep entries
short — this file is a compressed index, not a rewrite of architecture.md.

